type: software
title: "Adaptive Small Neural Networks on Two GPUs"
authors:
  - name: "gedizgursu"
abstract: >-
  A research study and minimal continuation for many small independent MIMO
  neural networks, GPU resource sharing, and live adaptation with separate
  training and inference devices. Dual-RTX-3060 performance is unverified.
keywords:
  - adaptive neural networks
  - online learning
  - multi-GPU
  - CUDA MPS
  - system identification
